<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Swiss banks basket.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Swiss banks basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Bank A.G. said it has issued four million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on a Swiss banks basket.</p>
<p>The equally weighted basket includes registered shares of CS</p>
<p>Holding, bearer shares of UBS and registered</p>
<p>shares of Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE BASKET.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	17.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1000 CHF</p>
<p>		STRIKE	 ISSUE	 PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p>		1000 CHF     8.70 CHF    8.70 PCT   11.49 X</p>
<p>		1050 CHF     6.85 CHF    11.85 PCT  14.60 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
